===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmaːlən/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-malen.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|aːlən|lang=de}}
* {{homophones|mahlen|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|malt|malte|gemalt}}

# to [[paint]] (''to create a painting'')

====Conjugation====
{{de-conj-weak|mal|gemalt|h}}

====Synonyms====
